Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.96,0:01:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a great voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.65,0:01:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.11,0:01:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Oozora Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm Manaka Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.16,0:01:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.95,0:01:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you too, Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.41,0:05:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.49,0:05:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.84,0:05:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now wait a second-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now why the heck are there two of you singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't this supposed to be a solo performance?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that girl next to Laala-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She's an amazing singer and dancer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.16,0:05:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This was supposed to be an Akari solo...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that cute little girl next to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, now that I'm lo around, I see a lot of unfamiliar faces...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.84,0:05:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not really sure how it happened, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu, Ai-katsu, Ai-katsu, Ai-katsu
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.39,0:05:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Oozora Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.05,0:05:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a third year at the Starlight Academy middle school!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.54,0:06:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Our school's holding an event today,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.15,0:06:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,a big idol meetup!/get-together,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.41,0:06:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's Starlight Academy's festival day!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.35,0:06:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kokone, Miyabi, and Niina showed up as our special guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.48,0:06:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almsot time for the performance to start!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.47,0:06:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're up first, Akari. Give them a performance to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.85,0:06:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can bet we'll be cheering you on from the audience!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Manaka Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Primary school 6th year!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we're having the "long time, no pri"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Parajuku Special Concert event!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tricolore's coming to be our special guests!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost concert time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're first up to pri today, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.81,0:06:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Being quick and decisive is the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.01,0:07:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them fired up with a great show!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.02,0:07:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.48,0:07:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Please scan the necessary amount of PriTickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.67,0:08:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaaat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.46,0:08:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-what the heck is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.94,0:08:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno! I've never seen this place before!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.12,0:08:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait a sec, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.86,0:08:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you an idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you an idol, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.41,0:08:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.09,0:08:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to be putting on a concert here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.26,0:08:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! I was, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Start Dash Sensation...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.11,0:08:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! That's the song I was supposed to sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.91,0:09:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.47,0:09:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a great song!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.01,0:09:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.94,0:09:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, would you like to perform together?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.54,0:09:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.19,0:09:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.82,0:09:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a great voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.28,0:09:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.97,0:09:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Oozora Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Manaka Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.35,0:09:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Excited to go on with you, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Same with you, Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.48,0:09:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's how it all happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.51,0:09:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We just kinda ended up singing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.61,0:09:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"We just kinda ended up up singing together!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.50,0:09:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What, is this normal to you-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.79,0:09:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That certainly sounds like something Akari would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:09:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.03,0:10:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just where in the world are we...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Headmistress Orihime, Mr. Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You lot certainly aren't Starlight Academy students.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.74,0:10:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm from Paprika Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.33,0:10:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,"Paprika"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I never heard of any schools with that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is PriPara, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"PriPara"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.63,0:10:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You've never heard of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara is an idol theme park where any girl can be an idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.22,0:10:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,When we enter with our PriTickets, everyone becomes an idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Any girl can be an idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.19,0:10:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,An idol park called PriPara?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.01,0:10:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm! How [fresh? idk]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess you guys can perform without going to PriPara, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Starlight Academy is dedicated to [raising?] idols
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.66,0:11:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,so we take lessons, go on the Starlight Stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and sometimes we get to do idol work outside school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are our idol activities, aka idol katsudou!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We call them "Aikatsu"!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.14,0:11:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"Idol katsudou"; Aikatsu for short!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A school dedicated to idoling...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.39,0:11:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So you guys have a school that's just about idols?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds so banger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to keep up with our regular studies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.95,0:11:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara and Starlight Academy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.22,0:11:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Two places have become one...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.49,0:11:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that's something I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.34,0:11:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Meganii, PriPara's operator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.25,0:11:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Meganee, PriPara's other operator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.89,0:11:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're from Starlight Academy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,yet your stage changed upon going to perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe the system did some sort of spatial transferrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean that Aikatsu system did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.39,0:11:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.07,0:11:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran a scan of the facility earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.39,0:11:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and a bug was detected in the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.71,0:12:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a glitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.77,0:12:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to talk to you two about your circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Both machines malfunctioning at the same time caused a rift in time and space.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Two worlds that were never supposed to overlap merged together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And in that rift, it would seem a special kind of place was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.26,0:12:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A rift containing two worlds?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.41,0:12:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we stuck here-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.45,0:12:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, the gates to both PriPara and Starlight Academy's worlds
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.40,0:12:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,haven't disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.90,0:12:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.92,0:12:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, you're able to come and go quite freely. I believe this is an entirely new area altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A brand-new area!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.36,0:12:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Lots of idols could gather here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.85,0:12:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You could say it's an idol paradise!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the school?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.65,0:12:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do about the shows scheduled after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.75,0:12:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the question... Everyone was looking forward to those.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.22,0:12:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,May I offer my opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.03,0:13:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The floor is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.15,0:13:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. We'll meet in the room over there. Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, they'll be a while, so feel free to talk amongst yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.72,0:13:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna hear all about Starlight Academy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'd love to learn all about PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.24,0:13:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.01,0:13:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Shinjou Hinaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.19,0:13:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pop fit slays!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.87,0:13:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Mirei! With a pop and a step, I've gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.34,0:13:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bangs and hairclip are just adorbs-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.39,0:13:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm Hikami Sumire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.01,0:14:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.18,0:14:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Dancing freely on stage
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.49,0:14:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The red rose of passion,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurebayashi Juri!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.81,0:14:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Always in top form
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and ready to strike first!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.59,0:14:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Toudou Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mucho gusto! Or should I say, pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.83,0:14:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Go. Well met.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Are you two twins?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.41,0:14:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are so lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.95,0:14:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.63,0:14:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are pretty cute, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.93,0:14:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're nothing compared to me and Reona.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Dorothy! That's rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.94,0:14:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the girl who dances like lightning,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.06,0:14:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurosawa Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm Amahane Madoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.79,0:14:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Super cool to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.83,0:14:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess they're not too shabby...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.79,0:14:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so many girls here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Plenty of demonic servants to be found!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.30,0:15:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so fun-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.26,0:15:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So freakin' cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really great with goats!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.39,0:15:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my friend, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.15,0:15:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the cheerful idol,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.93,0:15:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Doujima Niina!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.45,0:15:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Falulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them are the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.07,0:15:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange place...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the system!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara ding-dong...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.13,0:16:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We have an announcement regarding the status of the performances
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.81,0:16:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,please gather around the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come to a decision regarding the planned shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.19,0:16:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Though things may have started off with some unexpected issues,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.17,0:16:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,it's wonderful that idols from two different idol agencies,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Starlight Academy and PriPara,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,could meet and form bonds with one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.13,0:16:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.79,0:16:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,we've decided hold a joint [dunno what to do with live fest]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.47,0:16:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.46,0:16:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Singing, dancing, and freedom, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring along whoever you want to sing with you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and give everyone a performance to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.65,0:16:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,we can directly transmit any song into your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,so no need to worry if you don't already know the lyrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.76,0:16:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hop to it! The early bird gets the worm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.95,0:16:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's going to be our first singer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.23,0:16:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The idol of all idols;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.05,0:16:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,in other words, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.49,0:16:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The center of the universe...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.29,0:16:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kokoneー
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:16:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, Dorothy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:17:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be the most charming person in the whole world first, don'tcha think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.53,0:17:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there! You can't just interrupt me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.17,0:17:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyabi and I were going to sing first!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.97,0:17:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I already called dibs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.13,0:17:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nom me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.14,0:17:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite enough, Kokone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a little selfish of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.01,0:17:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree. You're causing quite a fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.65,0:17:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Such grace and insight...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.51,0:17:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a martial artist?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.35,0:17:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.70,0:17:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know some Naginata.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.47,0:17:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see such an extraordinary skill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.14,0:17:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us do battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I would love to engage you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.43,0:17:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.99,0:17:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's take this elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Of couirse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.83,0:17:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Sion? We got a performance to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.75,0:17:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyabi, what about singing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.38,0:18:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How about the two of us go then-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.04,0:18:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreams times effort, multiplied by friendship times friendship
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.06,0:18:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's marble mix it up! Off to paradise, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't even know the rules
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.08,0:18:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A miracle that'll make you do a double-take
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.06,0:18:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a couple of mixed up idols
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.16,0:18:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and a dream of Divine idolhood!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.33,0:18:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,An unstoppable beat
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.38,0:18:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not quite natural
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.28,0:18:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but not quite dolled up
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.36,0:18:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get a little girly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.27,0:18:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wearing a smile on our eyelids
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.81,0:18:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,po-po-n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.27,0:18:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,On my way to a brand new me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreams times effort
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyalume change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreams times effort
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.72,0:19:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Our voices multiplied by never giving up
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.21,0:19:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart-pounding and thrilling, time to marble mix it uo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.15,0:19:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not alone 'cause I'm with you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.62,0:19:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just anybody, it's you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.10,0:19:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A mysteriously magical future paradox!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.28,0:19:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Marble!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.37,0:19:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What a lovely show.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.42,0:19:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You two totally killed it up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.52,0:19:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.59,0:19:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'd like to give performing a try, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.47,0:19:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The stage is all yours. Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet everyone would love to hear your rendition of Tutu Ballerina!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.65,0:19:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of song is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:20:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a super aloof but stylish song!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.61,0:20:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want someone who can pull off the whole icy cold vibe, then look no further than Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pshuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.69,0:20:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.85,0:20:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She seemed pretty amicable to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.23,0:20:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Aroma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.25,0:20:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thou art demon kin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.81,0:20:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldst thou join us in subjugating this realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.01,0:20:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.02,0:20:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.62,0:20:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use hiding. Thy cards give thee away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.62,0:20:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thy art a vampire, predicting armageddon with thy cursed cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.61,0:20:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the designers could be a little demonic...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You do also enjoy fortune telling...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.46,0:20:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Join us and subjugate the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.51,0:20:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the offer, but I'd like to just perform...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She's out of control-pri...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.64,0:20:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say this calls for a Red Flash-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:20:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A pickled plum?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.73,0:20:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.20,0:20:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you prepared, my little cagebirds?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us make for the stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.41,0:21:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.23,0:21:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.60,0:21:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.63,0:21:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyabi, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.65,0:22:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we could sing together...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.02,0:22:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Those look like they're made out of super delicious candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.17,0:22:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks so cute but so munchable-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.39,0:22:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.34,0:22:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's lot of sweets in the lyrics, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.38,0:22:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet the clothes and the song taste amazing-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.42,0:22:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna sing my heart out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.02,0:22:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about we sing together!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.38,0:22:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, lemme sing with ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.11,0:22:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and sunny sweets, the occasional chocolate
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a bit of the decorations and you'll be delighted
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.10,0:23:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret, but the girls know it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.07,0:23:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweets are happy clothes, wouldn't you say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.29,0:23:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(Mysterious) A pleasant flavor
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.46,0:23:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(Special) Gentle and happy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.96,0:23:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A little sweet magic's gonna make your heart skip a beat
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.72,0:23:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Caramelizing your heart kinda like having your first crush
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.97,0:23:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pastel colored macarons that make you dance with delight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.99,0:23:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.50,0:23:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then your cheeks, ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.42,0:23:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The joy spreading through your heart like souffle chiffon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.43,0:23:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The power to make everyone become friends
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.80,0:24:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So wonderful. ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.51,0:24:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart-pounding, ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.24,0:24:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A sweet tale
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.88,0:24:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How long're you gonna do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.24,0:24:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody keeps beating us to the punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.04,0:24:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Say,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.01,0:24:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to sing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.30,0:24:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nono!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.27,0:24:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Risa!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.12,0:24:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.96,0:24:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A brand new day has dawned
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.65,0:24:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, lay hee! It's time to wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.36,0:25:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Over all the hills and even through the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.12,0:25:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a deep breath and relax
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.97,0:25:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Give all your worries the flick
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.80,0:25:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,(Gently, softly)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.15,0:25:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and leave them out to air atop a tree
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.07,0:25:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and bid them goodbye, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.10,0:25:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lively, energetic and full of life
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.40,0:25:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy as happy can be, we sing gently with a ho ho ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.80,0:25:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And friendly,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.63,0:25:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,as close as two friends can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.80,0:25:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So come join this song, lay hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.36,0:25:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey little goat! (Baa baa baa) Hey little bird! (Tweet tweet tweet)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.48,0:25:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyalume change!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.18,0:25:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey little pig! (oink oink oink) Hey, horses and cows! (Neigh, moo)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.91,0:26:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey little frog! (Ribbit ribbit) Hey little duck! (quack quack)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.15,0:26:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And hello to you, too! (heigh ho!) Come join us, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.77,0:26:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lively, energetic and full of life
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.22,0:26:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy as happy can be, we sing gently with a ho ho ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.45,0:26:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And friendly,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.44,0:26:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,as close as two friends can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.73,0:26:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come join this song, lay hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.47,0:26:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up your feet, raise your voice, and come join this song, lay hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.63,0:26:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.18,0:26:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,for me
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.77,0:26:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,to make my appearance!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.53,0:26:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gracias...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.82,0:26:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.72,0:27:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.01,0:27:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,De nada, señorita
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.60,0:27:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're most welcome, mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.14,0:27:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you rise with me
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.72,0:27:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,to zeal's stage?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.33,0:27:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You've the scent of a prodigy,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.80,0:27:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and even better,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.44,0:27:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't have one of those preposterous sentence-enders.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.25,0:27:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.52,0:27:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.05,0:27:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The blazing flame of revolution
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.00,0:27:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,ignited by the Shikyouin Hibiki!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.43,0:27:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You there, within that powerful yet weak-willed heart of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.84,0:27:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,find yourself spurred by revolution
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.47,0:28:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You there, heed now the future assured by my unerring nobility
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.61,0:28:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And leave the past behind
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.15,0:28:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Unsuited to such things as ladylike apparel or lipstick
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.41,0:28:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I am envied by god and mortal alike,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.73,0:28:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,for I am a Perfect Knight of Beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.38,0:28:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Pure Amore Love
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.15,0:28:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it bloom ever magnificently
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.39,0:28:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A casablanca bursting open like raging magma
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.03,0:28:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Amore, come here,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.00,0:28:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall tell you now the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.26,0:28:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What is “love”?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.46,0:28:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Love is merely a fantasy for fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.49,0:28:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet it is by the whims of love
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.29,0:28:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,that we two have been drawn here
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.88,0:28:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.42,0:29:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Amore, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.44,0:29:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Avert not your eyes from the flower;
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.57,0:29:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,its hue rivaling any shade of crimson
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.74,0:29:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This pristine frenzy is for you
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.00,0:29:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it’s for the sake of love
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.22,0:29:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and these dreams that “I” am here
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.60,0:29:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Juri, you were amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.96,0:29:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But what should we do...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.28,0:29:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Vanilla Chili Pepper's song is meant for three people...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.84,0:29:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That footwork...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.82,0:29:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Her swordsmanship is amazing, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.35,0:29:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That was an excellent rehearsal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.28,0:29:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my sincerest gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.86,0:30:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.28,0:30:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look forward to facing off with you one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.61,0:30:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.72,0:30:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to perform with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.77,0:30:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Opportunity only knocks once.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.14,0:30:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be glad to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.09,0:30:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren'tcha forgetting someone over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.56,0:30:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, haa..
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.82,0:30:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, haa..
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.45,0:30:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, haa..
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.39,0:30:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Dancing to the sun's rhythm, we dance and sing "Ole"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.44,0:30:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Different rhythmic stomps join together in unison
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.72,0:30:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's got things they love and things they don't
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.42,0:30:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No two people in the world are exactly alike, turning like the colors in a kaleidoscope
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.65,0:30:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.88,0:31:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and feel, feel, feel the energy
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.17,0:31:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make a move
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.32,0:31:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Give into the impulse and clap, clap, clap your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.13,0:31:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,one, two, three
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.21,0:31:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Step, step, step let it resonate
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.42,0:31:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Our miracle is just beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.94,0:31:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreams and aspirations are one in the same
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.37,0:31:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,giving birth to a neww dream
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.92,0:31:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Dance to your heart's content, chicas
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.09,0:31:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Our future is right around the corner
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.90,0:31:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now no one knows
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.46,0:31:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the sound of a melody yet to be heard
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.52,0:31:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But when we dance together,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.58,0:31:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,we can bring to future to us
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.84,0:32:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, ah..
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.99,0:32:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, ah..
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.13,0:32:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, ah..
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.25,0:32:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, ah..
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.88,0:32:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.09,0:32:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Reona and I are definitely going next, or you're gonna hear it from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.20,0:32:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.19,0:32:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara ding-dong...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.20,0:32:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about 6 PM. The area will soon be closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.00,0:32:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.99,0:32:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We agreed upon doing things by the PriPara system's rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.62,0:32:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,so no one is permitted to be here past 6 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.95,0:32:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We hate to disappoint everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.05,0:33:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over already...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.50,0:33:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wanted to sing more...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.90,0:33:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But in better news,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.40,0:33:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,whenever you visit this space,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.15,0:33:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,it may very well be possible to vist each other's worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.83,0:33:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This how we found each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.94,0:33:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,so let's take the time to get to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.98,0:33:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.00,0:33:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.05,0:33:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You can put on even more joint shows tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.52,0:33:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,See you
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.97,0:33:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.38,0:33:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.98,0:33:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.55,0:33:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a good day-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.48,0:33:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You all too!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.57,0:33:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.51,0:33:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking forward to tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.90,0:33:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, see you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.95,0:34:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.84,0:34:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Right back at'cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.72,0:34:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.55,0:34:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My dorm
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.58,0:34:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,is usually here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.71,0:34:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.51,0:34:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.31,0:34:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumire, Hinaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.02,0:34:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen what they're saying online?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.85,0:34:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,"The celebrity idol, Hoshimiya Ichigo
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.35,0:34:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,changed her name to Hoshimiya Pineapple"...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.26,0:34:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pineapple?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.58,0:34:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that it's not cute, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.23,0:34:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't picture that!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.82,0:34:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up in the news...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.28,0:34:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The idol group, Dancing Divas, have just announced they'll be disbanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.81,0:34:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They've said they'll be debuting as a group of treasure hunters from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.27,0:34:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.26,0:34:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not an actress in Aikatsu Teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.74,0:34:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but It's not a school teacher, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.03,0:34:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm a stageplay teacher?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.97,0:35:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.73,0:35:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my house, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.68,0:35:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is supposed to be an Italian restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.52,0:35:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh Big Sis, you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.71,0:35:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Non!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.42,0:35:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.82,0:35:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.40,0:35:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.60,0:35:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But, you called me "big sis"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.74,0:35:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,so you must be Non, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.65,0:35:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.36,0:35:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really me. Your brother, Nonsuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.46,0:35:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nonsuke"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.18,0:35:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Where did all these animals come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.77,0:35:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they're the mascots?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.63,0:35:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.59,0:35:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Our monja sign changed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.09,0:35:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's it "Monja Ninja" instead of "Ninja Monja"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.50,0:36:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's not that different...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.23,0:36:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.20,0:36:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.86,0:36:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something weird about the real world!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.80,0:36:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys had weird thing happen, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.39,0:36:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.09,0:36:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like this fusion has been affecting things in the outside world, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.44,0:36:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all rather worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.87,0:36:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We just wonder what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.06,0:36:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But, why man? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.81,0:36:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon doing some investigating, we uncovered a very significant fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.21,0:36:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Our two worlds connected,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.75,0:36:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and this fused space was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.68,0:36:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result, a fork in the space-time continuum appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.91,0:36:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A fork in the space-time continuum?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.28,0:36:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.73,0:36:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A fork path in the flow of time was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.61,0:36:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You've broken from the path in the flow of time you were supposed to follow,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.39,0:37:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and entered a different flow altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.97,0:37:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now new forks keep appearing,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.71,0:37:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and this space encounters new branches each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.70,0:37:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We've also discovered it's possible to jump to other parts of the path.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.40,0:37:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.90,0:37:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean we'll keep getting sent to other strange worlds?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.22,0:37:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.40,0:37:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll run into the next brance after three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.08,0:37:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've calculated the next one after that
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.00,0:37:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,will be 100 million years from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.52,0:37:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That long?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.79,0:37:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even begin to image what that'd be like-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.29,0:37:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So our original worlds will only continue to get farther away...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.08,0:37:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll never be able to return to our original worlds and see the people from them?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.63,0:37:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But my friends and family aren't here...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.14,0:37:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fans who cheer us on...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.06,0:37:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, is there anything we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.92,0:37:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is merely conjecture,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.89,0:37:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but if we were somehow able to jump back to the first point of divergence
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.92,0:38:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,it may be possible for us to return to the original timeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.11,0:38:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.96,0:38:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That I cannot say for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.03,0:38:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the power which creates and sustains this space
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.87,0:38:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,is idols' radiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.32,0:38:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If we were to be able to combine that radiance, we could bring about a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.13,0:38:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,An idol's...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.23,0:38:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,radiance...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.38,0:38:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do we combine it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.29,0:38:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.91,0:38:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's easy-peasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.53,0:38:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We just gotta put on a buncha shows!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.96,0:38:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ya think we'd shine really bright then?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.17,0:38:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.63,0:38:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.56,0:38:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to perform more anyways!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.37,0:38:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If we recruit our friends and sing the songs we like,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.07,0:38:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a lot we can sing-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.69,0:38:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hyped!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.36,0:39:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's only fair if Reona and I go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.07,0:39:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.84,0:39:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us sing with you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.33,0:39:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.76,0:39:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get hyped to the max!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.68,0:39:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.21,0:39:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultra maxxed!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.50,0:39:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody! We're gonna get everything back to normal in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.81,0:39:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You and me and a happy smiling shining happy train
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.02,0:39:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, mega lucky super sparkly lucky train
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.93,0:39:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Adventure's just around the corner
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.66,0:39:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,oh, my lucky tain!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.80,0:39:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Cinderella, and the clock's struck midnight
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.93,0:39:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(too bad(
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.78,0:39:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You want everyone to remember
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.85,0:39:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,(let's dance!)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.24,0:39:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Bid yourself from that night "goodbye"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.76,0:39:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuz tomorrow's back to normal
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.73,0:39:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just an unpolished gem
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.72,0:39:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,you just have to keep polishing yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.55,0:39:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Countless hours passing by
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.46,0:39:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's your super shiny, ultra sparkly lucky time
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.07,0:39:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a wish upon a shooting star before it passes you by
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.70,0:39:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can once again board that ultra cheerful happy train
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.83,0:39:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe sometimes you'll slip up
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.08,0:40:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but that might lead you to your treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.99,0:40:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my happy train
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.91,0:40:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart-pounding and thrilling -- oh my lucky train!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.69,0:40:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A small wormhole has appeared in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.18,0:40:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,10-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.05,0:40:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep up that momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.14,0:40:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Madoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.54,0:40:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.54,0:40:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a step forward and ring the bell of blessings
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.68,0:40:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and take a bite from this sweet, red apple
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.46,0:40:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,With just one bite,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.16,0:40:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you've already become our captive
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.68,0:40:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneel there before me
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.99,0:40:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My soul
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.91,0:41:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,twinges with unsatiable thirst
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.84,0:41:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We call out your name
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.76,0:41:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and invite you somewhere beyond fate
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.47,0:41:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,where darkness and light intermix
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.57,0:41:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Reversible Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.97,0:41:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A moebius strip wrapped around your finger
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.27,0:41:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The captivating demon and the smiling angel
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.75,0:41:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyalume change!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.77,0:41:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The captivating demon and the smiling angel
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.81,0:41:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember we two maidens
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.67,0:41:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Reversible-Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.02,0:41:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A moebius strip wrapped around your finger
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.93,0:42:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear not
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.04,0:42:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and yield yourself to us
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.36,0:42:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The Devil ＆ Angel;
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.77,0:42:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Worship we two maidens
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.09,0:42:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,An idol's radiance;
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.43,0:42:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,for that, you need look no further than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.76,0:42:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart beats to the rhythm of this magic ornamentation
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.16,0:42:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and I come alive with joy
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.94,0:42:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Love and dates -- it's all so boring
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.75,0:42:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, too, I want to dance
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.71,0:42:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart comes alight like raging fire
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.59,0:42:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The ttrobbing passion in my heart has no end
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.37,0:42:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,May this flower rooted deep inside my heart come into bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.30,0:42:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll shine even brighter than ever before
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.82,0:43:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bloom just as beautifully with the fire lit inside of me
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.45,0:43:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the red passion flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.03,0:43:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The flowers of my dream bloom splendidly
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.16,0:43:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Should these flower petals ever wither,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.79,0:43:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll return as buds once again
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.42,0:43:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the red passion flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.83,0:43:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time we go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.95,0:43:29.41,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,the Kansai team!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.10,0:43:32.40,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Let's give'em a good show!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.84,0:43:58.28,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Halt, I beseech of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.28,0:44:04.49,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,The cauldron of hell hath been opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.76,0:44:11.21,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,This is the beginning of the demons' night!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.21,0:44:16.79,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,It's finally our turn to sing and stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.80,0:44:22.68,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Gaarmageddon's show-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.68,0:44:29.58,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Then how about all 6 of us sing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.58,0:44:36.78,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Team Sekimageddon-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.79,0:44:42.64,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,The unspoken words hiding inside your heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.64,0:44:49.73,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Set them free and raise your voice
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.73,0:44:55.61,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Be the brightest version of yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.61,0:45:02.59,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,and take hold of all the things you love
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.59,0:45:08.58,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Winners and losers don't matter
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.58,0:45:15.67,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Come let's join hands
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.67,0:45:22.04,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Hey jimp! The part's just getting started!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.72,0:45:49.38,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Hey! Let's go, it's party time!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.77,0:45:52.07,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Let's dance with 1,2,3! Into the future! We're together forever
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.38,0:45:53.91,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,We're never ever going to give up, we swear on that
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.08,0:45:55.24,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,LEt's sing "I'll do my best"! Tomorrow will be even brighter
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.48,0:45:58.63,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.00,0:46:02.01,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Muster up your courage and search for joy
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.58,0:46:04.67,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,and take over PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.00,0:46:07.05,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,LEt's sing "I'll do my best"! Tomorrow will be even brighter
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.42,0:46:09.33,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Muster up your courage and search for joy
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.26,0:46:12.37,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,and take over PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.40,0:46:34.00,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,They've also produced radiance!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.00,0:46:39.18,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,We're so close to a miracle-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.68,0:46:45.14,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,The light faded...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.14,0:46:51.04,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,The wormhole in the sky has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.79,0:46:57.09,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,I suppose it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.09,0:47:01.58,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,But why...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.58,0:47:05.39,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,It seems we'll need more power if we're going to move this space...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.39,0:47:07.48,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,But can we even produce enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.48,0:47:13.35,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,What's with all this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.35,0:47:18.53,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,We've been performing day in and day out the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.53,0:47:24.89,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,How many times is it gonna take before it's enough?!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.99,0:47:30.37,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,After three days, it's gonna take 100 million years worth of power isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.07,0:47:28.11,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Can we even really bring about a miracle?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.54,0:47:32.75,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Will we ever be able to go back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.75,0:47:38.91,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,It'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.92,0:47:44.38,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,We can make a miracle happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.38,0:47:47.08,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,I know we can! No matter how much work it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.32,0:48:08.77,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.27,0:48:11.31,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,I'm with Laala! We can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.66,0:48:19.09,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,I mean, we almost did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.78,0:48:21.78,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.42,0:48:24.55,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,We were all just strangers who'd never met until yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.28,0:48:26.01,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,But this is how we met!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.54,0:48:30.71,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,And we've been doing so many wonderful shows!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.32,0:48:33.08,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,You know, when I first met you, I was really surprised!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.45,0:48:34.70,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,But when we ended up performing together, I had so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.70,0:48:37.10,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.46,0:48:39.93,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,It really felt like the start of something new!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.93,0:48:43.32,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Laala...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.81,0:48:46.08,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.83,0:48:50.14,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.53,0:48:52.29,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.55,0:48:54.56,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Let's sing together!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.96,0:48:57.41,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate amount of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.87,0:48:58.36,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.93,0:49:01.47,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,The pink checks and layers are simply stunning!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.17,0:49:04.43,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Just like the Starlight Academy Marching Coord
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.29,0:49:06.10,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Pink Parade Coord
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.46,0:49:09.83,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Even in another world, the feeling stays the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.83,0:49:11.61,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,The cute ribbons tie your memories together!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.37,0:49:15.11,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Twinkle Ribbon Cyalume Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.75,0:49:19.85,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Stop trying to be like all those other girls you see
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.26,0:49:23.38,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,You're better off just being yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.00,0:49:25.18,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,If you feel the spark in your heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.18,0:49:27.04,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,come search for your ideals
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.59,0:49:28.59,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Every single memory we've made,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.81,0:49:30.01,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,we'll snap'em in half
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.27,0:49:32.27,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,and complete the set with our friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.09,0:49:34.09,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Make it! Once you get started, you're invicible!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.68,0:49:36.95,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Make up! Headed towards a radiant future
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.25,0:49:44.64,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Making Drama, switch on!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.73,0:49:55.46,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,That dream's not just a dream anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.36,0:50:00.43,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,You can dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.80,0:50:03.16,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Anyone can be anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.95,0:50:06.37,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,You can walk the runway!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.49,0:50:12.03,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Sing a song!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.75,0:50:14.94,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Let's make a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.69,0:50:18.21,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.55,0:50:42.97,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,MAke it! Giving up on that dream is just not in the cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.19,0:50:48.49,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Make up!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.76,0:50:54.07,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Make it! Once you get started, you're invicible!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.31,0:50:59.55,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Make up! Headed towards a radiant future
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.55,0:51:05.41,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Your dream's not just a dream anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.12,0:51:08.74,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Anyone can be anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.74,0:51:14.25,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,PriPara PriPara-dise
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.61,0:51:21.84,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Laala! Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.10,0:51:27.37,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.84,0:51:31.13,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Something about the show you just did really lifted our spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.53,0:51:36.82,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,It makes me believe we can pull off a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.70,0:51:41.08,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Indeed! You're laser focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.87,0:51:45.32,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,We'll have to give gathering the idols radiance another go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.67,0:51:50.02,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Laser focused?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.25,0:51:55.38,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Actually, I've been thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.51,0:52:01.01,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,we've been doing all these thrown together performances, but what if instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.21,0:52:06.44,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,we prepared for one big, best of the best performance intsead?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.70,0:52:11.98,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,All of together for the best performance ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.35,0:52:17.89,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,So you're saying we should all work together for one big show-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.89,0:52:21.50,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,That sounds so fun-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.50,0:52:24.16,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,We could have the people who perform on stage and the people who support from the audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.87,0:52:36.87,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,We'd be bringing all our radiance together as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.81,0:52:38.68,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,That certainly sounds like an idea worth trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.40,0:52:42.63,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,In that case, we'll hold the show after three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.23,0:52:45.84,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Otherwise that's our last chance for another 100 million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.50,0:52:48.55,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,But who should we choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.05,0:52:51.89,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Obviously it's--
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.25,0:52:53.55,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.69,0:52:56.74,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Wouldn't Laala and Akari be good choices?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.75,0:53:00.38,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.38,0:53:03.09,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,They were the first of us to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.73,0:53:06.11,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.57,0:53:10.04,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Miss Akari and Miss Laala will be the centers
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.37,0:53:11.95,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,in a brand new idol group!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.67,0:53:16.13,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,Then it's gotta be
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.56,0:53:19.19,Default,Next up,0,0,0,,the ones who had a smash hit concert! The super idols, Luminas!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.46,0:53:23.88,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,SoLaMi Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.44,0:53:26.65,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,The new team will be made of these six members!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.31,0:53:31.05,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,They're SoLaMi Luminas!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.99,0:53:34.03,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.12,0:53:35.05,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Tch. Fine, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.05,0:53:35.73,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,If it's support we must play, then I suppose we'll just have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.38,0:53:39.24,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,So then what are the supporters supposed to do-garu?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.72,0:53:40.36,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.75,0:53:42.88,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,We could create a new ultimate special appeal...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.65,0:53:45.02,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,And then we can create a new Making Drama!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.02,0:53:47.70,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Why don't we work on it together?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.95,0:53:50.21,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,A Making Drama and Special Appeal put together... I like the sound of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.57,0:53:52.66,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,It's a Special Making Drama Appeal!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.18,0:53:57.76,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Aha. That's a bit long.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.32,0:54:02.00,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,How about Making Appeal!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.01,0:54:05.35,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,That sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.69,0:54:07.38,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,If Kiriya was here, she'd say "isn't this chill?"
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.38,0:54:08.46,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,If Ms. Ajimi was here, she'd say
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.65,0:54:10.60,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,"
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.60,0:54:13.85,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,That settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.98,0:54:17.15,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,The six members of SoLaMi Luminas will prepare to take the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.76,0:54:18.78,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Everyone else should put forth maximum effort to support them.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.78,0:54:21.85,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.39,0:54:25.69,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,The three of us will work on putting together the best song for the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.32,0:54:28.49,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's get amped!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.56,0:54:33.57,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,We'll be doing everything we can to support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.57,0:54:36.37,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Stylish!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.38,0:54:38.00,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.21,0:54:40.03,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Collaboration!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.38,0:54:42.49,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.94,0:54:45.93,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Isn't there one more thing you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.40,0:54:48.68,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Tsubasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.68,0:54:50.85,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Cosmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.44,0:54:54.46,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,The best performance deserves the best outfits, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.18,0:54:59.02,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,We've got this cosmic covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.79,0:55:03.39,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Laala and her friends should be here any minute now!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.65,0:55:04.65,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to practicing with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.87,0:55:07.98,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.40,0:55:10.42,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.00,0:55:13.45,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.16,0:55:15.19,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Nice to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.74,0:55:17.37,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Oh, Sophy?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.90,0:55:19.63,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,I'm down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.63,0:55:20.79,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,How's it going? Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.73,0:55:23.87,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Huh? That's you, Laala?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.62,0:55:25.59,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,So you really are a primary schooler...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.59,0:55:26.59,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Then does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.13,0:55:30.36,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,You're Mirei?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.36,0:55:32.40,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Is it really that surprisng...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.24,0:55:42.48,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.99,0:55:45.30,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.17,0:55:47.16,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Thanks for having us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.16,0:55:47.74,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.17,0:55:49.17,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,You good with doing our regular old training?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.63,0:55:50.81,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's totally okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.42,0:55:53.21,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu, ai-katsu, ai-katsu
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.21,0:55:54.68,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Their stamina is unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.50,0:55:57.92,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,We're going to have to work overtime if we want to catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.31,0:55:59.65,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,We're not gonna fall behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.29,0:56:02.04,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Pri! Para! Pri! Para!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.33,0:56:03.33,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.73,0:56:05.62,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.99,0:56:07.11,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.60,0:56:10.09,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Rock climbing...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.73,0:56:11.76,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,If this is what the Starlight Academy students are doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.76,0:56:13.01,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,then it's no wonder their idol abilities are on another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.41,0:56:15.06,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Just a little longer! Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.57,0:56:16.38,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,C-Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.54,0:56:19.93,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Pshuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.40,0:56:22.04,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Oh no! Sophy got blown away!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.02,0:56:28.01,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,The center of the universe...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.75,0:56:33.77,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Kokone!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.98,0:56:36.21,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,I think ya mean me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.21,0:56:38.89,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.10,0:56:41.16,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.08,0:56:45.00,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.38,0:57:02.32,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.61,0:57:04.72,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,They just can't get their act together.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.40,0:57:09.90,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,But despite that, we've been making good prgoress.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.54,0:57:15.45,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Yeah! This is looking to be one awesome Making Appeal!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.56,0:57:18.94,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,It's chock full of idols' radiance!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.59,0:57:21.87,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Are we sure we can pull this off?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.21,0:57:24.59,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,We only have one chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.77,0:57:31.18,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,That's quite true.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.18,0:57:33.63,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,If it doesn't end up being the best concert anyone's ever seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.04,0:57:39.58,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,it'll be a big failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.99,0:57:40.76,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Hearing that gives me anxiety!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.76,0:57:42.29,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,It still feels like something's missing...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.94,0:57:44.48,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Yeah, but thwat...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.48,0:57:45.04,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Headmistress, we have a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.06,0:57:46.15,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Whatever is the matter, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.15,0:57:46.73,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,When we were meeting about the new song, I heard from MegaBro —
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.45,0:57:50.57,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,"MegaBro"?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.11,0:57:53.41,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean Meganii?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.03,0:57:57.28,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.60,0:58:00.22,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,I found out something that was totally shocking!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.92,0:58:02.61,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.23,0:58:04.98,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,The next performance will be the last one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.61,0:58:06.61,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Darn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.87,0:58:09.47,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Er, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.47,0:58:11.13,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,The power of our idols will return things to normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.71,0:58:14.29,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,and the two worlds will separate.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.74,0:58:16.76,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,We'll be cut off from each other forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.52,0:58:19.96,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,So after that, we won't be able to meet up any more?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.11,0:58:26.20,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.41,0:58:28.67,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,To make matters worse, all of our memories of this will disappear too.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.38,0:58:32.88,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,I see. So we'll forget all about this wonderful meeting...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.88,0:58:34.01,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,How unfortunate...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.44,0:58:36.52,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.52,0:58:37.28,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,I should tell Oozora and the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.56,0:58:40.47,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,I just hope it doesn't make them hesitant to go on...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.46,0:58:42.08,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Well, about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.53,0:58:44.23,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,You've already told everyone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.59,0:58:45.39,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.39,0:58:46.25,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,I had the opportunity to gether everyone earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.06,0:58:51.84,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,So how did they take the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.84,0:58:53.84,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,This is their final performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.84,0:58:56.35,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,They're not going to be able to do things together anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.76,0:59:03.10,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Everyone was shocked at first, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.61,0:59:04.30,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,But it wasn't long before they shifted and said,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.76,0:59:07.98,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Who decided that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.44,0:59:11.81,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,If it'll take a miracle to turn our worlds back, then we'll just make another miracle so we can meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.36,0:59:13.33,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,We've made miracles before and we can do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.48,0:59:14.44,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,"We'll give it our everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.86,0:59:17.36,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,"
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.36,0:59:20.29,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,We have to place our faith in our radiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.73,0:59:22.37,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.34,0:59:24.93,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,we're idols!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.50,0:59:25.90,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,We should place our hopes in them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.61,0:59:29.67,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,I know those girls can bring about a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.28,0:59:32.31,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu! Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.88,0:59:35.80,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,So this is PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.06,0:59:37.84,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Everything here is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.91,0:59:42.26,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,You could come here every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.79,0:59:45.77,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,And look at all those animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.51,0:59:48.17,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Pri-Para! Pri-Para!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.80,0:59:52.51,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Oh, Laala. You're as lively as ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.00,0:59:56.03,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Something about being in idol in PriPara
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.38,0:59:57.84,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,increases my power by 100 times!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.84,1:00:00.05,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Your idol aura's increased 100 times over, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.83,1:00:02.11,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,That's the power of PriPara-pri!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.68,1:00:03.86,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,You're far too slow, my little cagebirds!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.45,1:00:11.66,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Holy moly!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.58,1:00:14.91,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,And that's the power of pickled plums-pri.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.33,1:00:18.28,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Hologrammation!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.81,1:00:19.87,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,We used the power of hologrammation to construct a 3000 meter rock wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.29,1:00:21.82,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.22,1:00:23.75,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.13,1:00:25.94,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.35,1:00:28.54,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,This is the first I've ever
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.68,1:00:32.30,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,climbed a rock wall this tall.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.63,1:00:35.58,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,PriPara is something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.58,1:00:37.58,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,This is my winning idiot power!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.99,1:00:39.99,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,With the power of both effort and calculations, we can't be beat!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.40,1:00:42.35,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.56,1:00:46.55,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Pri-Para!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.14,1:00:48.54,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.79,1:00:50.78,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Pri...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.18,1:00:53.63,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Ah, I give up! I'm out of ideas!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.66,1:01:01.08,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Then a change of pace is in order.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.39,1:01:02.63,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,At times like this, it's best to get up and moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.69,1:01:05.39,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.94,1:01:07.64,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so lovely!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.67,1:01:10.22,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,After that conversation, we all thought there must be some way we can pitch in!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.52,1:01:12.52,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,We want the stage itself to be able to give off the brightest shine!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.15,1:01:14.79,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,This is our aikatsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.50,1:01:20.43,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,This is our way to say "we're all idols"!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.95,1:01:23.53,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,It's like everyone's [whatever word I used before]
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.48,1:01:26.22,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,has come together!/united
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.85,1:01:28.49,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Excelente!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.97,1:01:30.66,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,In other words, fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.15,1:01:31.99,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,It's time for us to pull ourselves together.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.03,1:01:39.14,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.74,1:01:40.99,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Let's climb together!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.43,1:01:44.31,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.88,1:01:48.67,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Each and every one of us shines in our own way.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.57,1:01:52.85,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,And when we bring all of our [word I used] together,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.33,1:01:57.73,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,I know we'll put on the greatets show ever!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.49,1:02:01.05,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Whatcha guys lollygagging around for?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.28,1:02:03.28,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Have you all forgotten about the Making Appeal?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.58,1:02:06.34,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Has hell's banquet not started?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.91,1:02:10.26,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Alright. Let's go wrap things up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.26,1:02:11.87,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.87,1:02:13.45,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,We finally made it...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.84,1:02:16.38,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,The sky looks stunning...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.94,1:02:17.94,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,I hope everything works out tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.26,1:02:26.40,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,We won't know until we try-pri.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.28,1:02:27.98,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,All we can do is give it our all.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.89,1:02:32.98,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.88,1:02:36.60,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Let's have fun and go all out!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.47,1:02:40.09,Default,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,0,0,0,,Capisce!
